le lists.\n\nI also need to add node -e preference guidance to the orchestrator template's administrative utilities section, incorporate time-budget awareness into the orchestrator's decision-making, and document the resume-from-partial workflow.\n\nLet me check the coder status.json structure to see if it already captures file lists.",
